
<!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="pt-BR"> <head> <meta charset="UTF-8"> <title>Protocolo M-2030</title> <style> body { margin: 0; font-family: "Orbitron", sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(#000000, #1a1a1a); color: #fff; text-align: center; }
header {
  background: #111;
